CDRF: Cross-Domain Robustness Evaluation Framework
for Multimodal Harmful Meme Understanding

This file documents the complete experimental protocol used in the
manuscript. It is intended as a reproducibility specification rather
than as a one-click training script.

The experiments were conducted using frozen dataset splits, frozen
CLIP-based multimodal representations, and predefined downstream
learning configurations. The purpose of this file is to document:

    Dataset
        -> Multimodal representation
        -> Downstream learning strategy
        -> Source/target protocol
        -> Target-domain evaluation
        -> CDRI3
        -> Cross-domain robustness diagnostics

The numerical results are consolidated in:
    results/master_cross_domain_results_69d_v1.csv

This file does NOT automatically retrain the models. It records the
experimental design and configurations required to reproduce the study.
"""


