# 24. SCOPE AND INTERPRETATION
# =============================================================================

SCOPE = """
CDRF is an evaluation framework/protocol for cross-domain robustness.

The present experiments demonstrate the framework using:

    - one frozen CLIP-based multimodal representation
    - three downstream learning strategies
    - three harmful/offensive meme datasets
    - forward and reverse transfer
    - external-domain validation

The study therefore does not claim that the observed behaviour is invariant
across all multimodal representation models, jointly trained
vision-language architectures, or all harmful-content datasets.

The framework is formulated to accommodate alternative representations,
datasets, downstream strategies, and evaluation settings in future work.
"""


